  - id: chosen_before_foundation_ephesians
    displayName: Chosen Before the Foundation of the World
    flavorText: God blesses believers with every spiritual blessing, choosing and
      predestinating them to adoption before the world itself was made.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Establishes the believer's standing as chosen by God's grace before
      creation itself \u2014 predestined to adoption, redeemed through Christ's blood,
      and sealed with the Holy Spirit as \"the earnest of our inheritance\" \u2014
      teaching that salvation's origin lies entirely in God's own will and grace,
      not human merit."
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_ephesians
    managerId: chosen_before_foundation_ephesians
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 24.131744431604677
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
    baseInkPerSecond: 1.2065872215802338
