    managerBonusMultiplier: 0.25
    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: eyes_of_understanding_ephesians
    displayName: The Eyes of Your Understanding
    flavorText: Paul prays that the eyes of their understanding be enlightened to
      know the hope of their calling and the surpassing power that raised Christ
      from the dead.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Paul's prayer that the saints receive \"the spirit of wisdom and revelation\"
      to grasp the hope of their calling and the riches of God's inheritance \u2014
      grounded in the \"exceeding greatness of his power,\" the same power that raised
      Christ from the dead and seated him far above every rule and authority as head
      over the church, \"which is his body.\""
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_ephesians
    managerId: eyes_of_understanding_ephesians
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 58.23410893122833
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
    baseInkPerSecond: 2.9117054465614163
    unlockAtVerseIndex: 21
    managerName: 
    managerFlavorText: 
    managerUnlockLevel: 0
    managerUnlockAtVerseIndex: 0
    managerBonusMultiplier: 0.25
    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: quickened_with_christ_ephesians
    displayName: Quickened Together With Christ
    flavorText: God, rich in mercy, makes the spiritually dead alive together with
      Christ, saving them by grace through faith and not of works.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Describes salvation as God's rescue of the spiritually dead \u2014
      \"by grace are ye saved through faith... not of works, lest any man should
      boast\" \u2014 teaching that believers are entirely God's own \"workmanship,
      created in Christ Jesus unto good works,\" so that good works are the fruit
      of grace, never its cause."
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_ephesians
    managerId: quickened_with_christ_ephesians
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 140.52906339306293
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
    baseInkPerSecond: 7.026453169653147
    unlockAtVerseIndex: 32
    managerName: 
    managerFlavorText: 
    managerUnlockLevel: 0
    managerUnlockAtVerseIndex: 0
    managerBonusMultiplier: 0.25
    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: one_new_man_ephesians
    displayName: One New Man
    flavorText: Christ breaks down the middle wall of partition between Jew and Gentile,
      making the two into one new man and one holy temple in the Lord.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Explains the reconciliation of Jew and Gentile in Christ \u2014 the
      \"middle wall of partition\" broken down, both made into \"one new man\" and
      built together as \"an holy temple in the Lord,\" with Christ himself as the
      \"chief corner stone\" \u2014 teaching that peace between former strangers
      is achieved specifically through the cross, not mere goodwill."
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_ephesians
    managerId: one_new_man_ephesians
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 339.12114430141673
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
    baseInkPerSecond: 16.956057215070835
    unlockAtVerseIndex: 43
    managerName: 
    managerFlavorText: 
    managerUnlockLevel: 0
    managerUnlockAtVerseIndex: 0
    managerBonusMultiplier: 0.25
    managerUnlockCost: 0
    submanagers: []
  - id: mystery_made_known_ephesians
    displayName: The Mystery Made Known
    flavorText: 'A mystery hidden for ages is now revealed by the Spirit to God''s
      holy apostles and prophets: that the Gentiles are fellowheirs of the same promise
      in Christ.'
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Explains the \"mystery of Christ\" specifically revealed to Paul by
      revelation \u2014 that the Gentiles are \"fellowheirs, and of the same body,
      and partakers of his promise in Christ by the gospel\" \u2014 and grounds Paul's
      own calling as apostle to the Gentiles in this revealed mystery, not personal
      ambition."
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_ephesians
    managerId: mystery_made_known_ephesians
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 818.3584785635118
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
